    "source": "Book 'Declaração Final dos Encontros do Foro de São Paulo (1990-2012)' (V. Pomar & R. Regalado, Fundação Perseu Abramo, 2013) — the Forum published its chapters as numbered PDFs under wp-content/uploads/2014/07/. The chapter number IS the official edition number.",
